#: config.cpp:41
msgid "Draw titlebar &stipple effect"
msgstr "Darlunio effaith &dotwaith y bar teitl"

#: config.cpp:43
msgid ""
"When selected, active titlebars are drawn with a stipple (dotted) effect. "
"Otherwise, they are drawn without the stipple."
msgstr ""
"Pan yn ddewisiedig, darlunir barrau teitl gweithredol âg effaith dotwaith. "
"Heblaw hynny, fe'u darlunir heb y dotwaith."

#: config.cpp:47
msgid "Draw g&rab bar below windows"
msgstr "Darlunio bar &cydio o dan ffenestri"

#: config.cpp:49
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with a \"grab bar\" below windows. "
"Otherwise, no grab bar is drawn."
msgstr ""
"Pan yn ddewisiedig, darlunir addurniadau â \"bar cydio\" ar waelod ffenestri. "
"Heblaw hynny, ni ddarlunir bar cydio."

#: config.cpp:55
msgid "Draw &gradients"
msgstr "Darlunio &graddliwiau"

#: config.cpp:57
msgid ""
"When selected, decorations are drawn with gradients for highcolor displays, "
"otherwise no gradients are drawn."
msgstr ""
"Pan yn ddewisiedig, darlunir addurniadau â graddliwiau ar gyfer dangosyddion "
"lliw uchel, heblaw hynny, ni ddarlunir graddliwiau."

#: config.cpp:64
msgid "&Titlebar height:"
msgstr "Taldra'r bar &teitl:"

#: config.cpp:70
msgid ""
"By adjusting this slider, you can modify the height of the titlebar to make "
"room for larger fonts."
msgstr ""
"Drwy addasu'r llithrydd yma, gallwch addasu taldra'r bar teitl i wneud lle "
"ar gyfer wynebfathau mwy."

#: config.cpp:75
msgid ""
"_: titlebar height\n"
"Normal"
msgstr "Arferol"

#: config.cpp:76
msgid ""
"_: titlebar height\n"
"Large"
msgstr "Mawr"

#: config.cpp:78
msgid ""
"_: titlebar height\n"
"Huge"
msgstr "Anferth"

